        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who is it for?",
            "answer": "<p>Adults who know a little Spanish from school, an app or a holiday and want to talk. If you have never learned any, start with the free lesson and see how it feels.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Spain or Latin America?",
            "answer": "<p>Both. Every phrase is recorded by a speaker from Spain and one from Mexico, and the lessons say where words differ.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I have to speak on the calls?",
            "answer": "<p>That is what they are for, but gently. You talk in groups of four at your level, with the week's phrases in front of you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I miss a live call?",
            "answer": "<p>Every call is recorded and added the same day. Book a spare place on the next group's call and you can join that one instead.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do I keep the lessons?",
            "answer": "<p>For as long as the course exists. Lessons, recordings and the phrase cards stay in your account, and updates are free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pay in parts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. At checkout choose three monthly payments instead of one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
